Comment: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:12.46,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,全神贯注
Comment: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:19.38,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,保持警惕 直到你看见真实世界
Comment: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:21.62,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,抓住机会
Comment: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:25.64,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,直到你终结游戏 答案才会浮现
Comment: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:28.60,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,你必须亲自出马
Comment: 0,0:04:30.23,0:04:31.77,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,是时候觉醒了
Comment: 0,0:04:31.77,0:04:37.53,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,是时候去寻找被隐藏至深的真相
Comment: 0,0:04:37.53,0:04:41.66,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,你准备好倒计时了吗
Comment: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:44.28,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,你知道未来无定数
Comment: 0,0:04:44.32,0:04:50.16,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,但我们的选择至关重要
Comment: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:53.78,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,前路漫漫 未来似乎不堪一击
Comment: 0,0:04:53.78,0:05:01.26,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,真相也只会让你窒息
Comment: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:13.98,Screen,,0,0,0,,=== OPEN ===
Comment: 1,0:04:10.60,0:04:12.46,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Open up your senses
Comment: 1,0:04:12.46,0:04:19.38,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Keep your guard up 'till you see the real world
Comment: 1,0:04:19.38,0:04:21.62,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Gotta take your chances
Comment: 1,0:04:21.62,0:04:25.64,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,You won't find your answers 'till you end the game
Comment: 1,0:04:25.64,0:04:28.60,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,With your own hands
Comment: 1,0:04:30.23,0:04:31.77,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's about time we wake up
Comment: 1,0:04:31.77,0:04:37.53,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Time we start to see the truth hidden beneath
Comment: 1,0:04:37.53,0:04:41.66,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Are you ready for the countdown
Comment: 1,0:04:41.68,0:04:44.28,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,You see the future's never certain
Comment: 1,0:04:44.32,0:04:50.16,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,But it's governed by the choices that we make
Comment: 1,0:04:50.87,0:04:53.78,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,You're standing on a fragile future
Comment: 1,0:04:53.78,0:05:01.26,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,And the truth will take your breath away
Comment: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:13.98,Screen,,0,0,0,,=== END ===
