Dialogue: 2,0:36:09.86,0:36:10.71,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\an5\pos(1700,622)\bord2\shad0\1c&H29B8F5&\3c&H3838D8&\p1}m 30 0 b 33 0 35 3 37 6 l 58 43 b 60 47 58 51 52 51 l 8 51 b 2 51 0 47 2 43 l 23 6 b 25 3 27 0 30 0{\p0}
