Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.02,0:42:53.85,EDCN,,0,0,0,,远古神明从异界创造的奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.52,0:42:58.53,EDCN,,0,0,0,,文明曙光初现时的宇宙震颤
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.74,0:43:01.27,EDCN,,0,0,0,,我们曾熟识每个晨露滴落的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.27,0:43:03.57,EDCN,,0,0,0,,站在万物新生的至高点
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.57,0:43:05.83,EDCN,,0,0,0,,学会制造工具的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.83,0:43:08.03,EDCN,,0,0,0,,在即兴规则中寻找出路
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.03,0:43:10.54,EDCN,,0,0,0,,我们写下从天而降的法则
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.54,0:43:12.87,EDCN,,0,0,0,,唯一要战胜的 是对恶魔的恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.87,0:43:15.08,EDCN,,0,0,0,,可怕的是我们正与时间赛跑
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.08,0:43:17.29,EDCN,,0,0,0,,当夕阳西沉 对你的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.29,0:43:20.01,EDCN,,0,0,0,,驱使我探索这颗星球的每个角落
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.01,0:43:22.30,EDCN,,0,0,0,,我们的旅程将自然发生
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.51,0:43:24.35,EDCN,,0,0,0,,让渴望继续燃烧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.35,0:43:27.01,EDCN,,0,0,0,,直到寻得所求 不留遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.01,0:43:30.85,EDCN,,0,0,0,,远古神明从异界创造的奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.64,0:43:35.49,EDCN,,0,0,0,,文明曙光初现时的宇宙震颤
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.06,0:43:36.94,EDCN,,0,0,0,,醒来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.16,0:43:38.15,EDCN,,0,0,0,,醒来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.15,0:43:40.11,EDCN,,0,0,0,,迎接文明破晓的曙光
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.79,0:43:41.44,EDCN,,0,0,0,,醒来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.95,0:43:42.74,EDCN,,0,0,0,,醒来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.74,0:43:44.95,EDCN,,0,0,0,,迎接文明破晓的曙光
Comment: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:02.50,Screen,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:50.02,0:42:53.85,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Ancient creations by the Gods from another dimension
Dialogue: 1,0:42:54.52,0:42:58.53,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Cosmic sensation since the dawn of a civilization
Dialogue: 1,0:42:58.74,0:43:01.27,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Every moment we knew each morning dew
Dialogue: 1,0:43:01.27,0:43:03.57,EDEN,,0,0,0,,We were at the most prominent point all new
Dialogue: 1,0:43:03.57,0:43:05.83,EDEN,,0,0,0,,We learned how to make tools to make tools
Dialogue: 1,0:43:05.83,0:43:08.03,EDEN,,0,0,0,,And make do with the play-calling audible
Dialogue: 1,0:43:08.03,0:43:10.54,EDEN,,0,0,0,,We wrote all the rules that came down from the heavens
Dialogue: 1,0:43:10.54,0:43:12.87,EDEN,,0,0,0,,All we had to lose was the fear of the devils
Dialogue: 1,0:43:12.87,0:43:15.08,EDEN,,0,0,0,,And it's horrible we're running out of time
Dialogue: 1,0:43:15.08,0:43:17.29,EDEN,,0,0,0,,When the sun is setting and the thought of you
Dialogue: 1,0:43:17.29,0:43:20.01,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Got me gunning for more to explore this planet
Dialogue: 1,0:43:20.01,0:43:22.30,EDEN,,0,0,0,,We can go on tour and it happens organic
Dialogue: 1,0:43:22.51,0:43:24.35,EDEN,,0,0,0,,So let the desires burn
Dialogue: 1,0:43:24.35,0:43:27.01,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Till we find what we came for no stone unturned
Dialogue: 1,0:43:27.01,0:43:30.85,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Ancient creations by the Gods from another dimension
Dialogue: 1,0:43:31.64,0:43:35.49,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Cosmic sensation since the dawn of a civilization
Dialogue: 1,0:43:35.49,0:43:36.06,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Yo
Dialogue: 1,0:43:36.06,0:43:36.94,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Wake up
Dialogue: 1,0:43:37.16,0:43:38.15,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Wake up
Dialogue: 1,0:43:38.15,0:43:40.11,EDEN,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a civilization
Dialogue: 1,0:43:40.79,0:43:41.44,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Wake up
Dialogue: 1,0:43:41.95,0:43:42.74,EDEN,,0,0,0,,Wake up
Dialogue: 1,0:43:42.74,0:43:44.95,EDEN,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a civilization
